                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eac5cd64-022a-39d3-985a-96c5c5c44008",
                        "entry_id": "9424e1bd-2cd4-35d4-a6ff-43ae47081e0e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "публично, в торжественной обстановке приветствовать, поздравлять, оказывать почести кому-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "59dc62d1-8750-47a8-80ab-ca7da8064e12",
                                "sense_id": "eac5cd64-022a-39d3-985a-96c5c5c44008",
                                "text": "Само собою разумеется, что он принимал, угощал и чествовал старика, как родного отца."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "868ed8b4-7320-4bd3-9d86-2a034f6edffa",
                                "sense_id": "eac5cd64-022a-39d3-985a-96c5c5c44008",
                                "text": "… —… Бывало, выйдет на базар-то, — продолжал он, — все кланяются, чествуют, одно слово — богатей."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c04e070-67b9-4891-867d-3eefa5e71daa",
                                "sense_id": "eac5cd64-022a-39d3-985a-96c5c5c44008",
                                "text": "— Я, брат Родя, у вас тут теперь каждый день так обедаю, — пробормотал он, насколько позволял набитый полный рот говядиной, — и это всё Пашенька, твоя хозяюшка, хозяйничает, от всей души меня чествует."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "afae0053-e6de-4d30-b2d2-2739e8f3ca6d",
                                "sense_id": "eac5cd64-022a-39d3-985a-96c5c5c44008",
                                "text": "Гвардейцы рассказывали Ростову о своем походе, о том, как их чествовали в России, Польше и за границей."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3526053f-73e3-34bc-aa49-4c9862e81c55",
                        "entry_id": "9424e1bd-2cd4-35d4-a6ff-43ae47081e0e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. величать, именовать"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b73184a7-293f-41a9-88a9-7405fb8f4f96",
                                "sense_id": "3526053f-73e3-34bc-aa49-4c9862e81c55",
                                "text": "— Изволите видеть-с, милостивый государь, не имею удовольствия знать, как вас чествовать, — сказал рыжий, — ведь-с это только между дворянами такая заведенция, что расписки да векселя."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "068e22e7-7711-42d3-9130-7df5e55421d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "9424e1bd-2cd4-35d4-a6ff-43ae47081e0e",
                        "target_lang_word": "celebrate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "celebrate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e399de0d-ad16-38ee-9250-bd9d39f1d030",
                                        "entry_id": "6cbd5a5a-aa79-3287-92cb-ed2efb6a2c43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To extol or honour in a solemn manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa336ca7-0587-4c39-9290-8c0ed14520e8",
                                                "sense_id": "e399de0d-ad16-38ee-9250-bd9d39f1d030",
                                                "text": "to celebrate the name of the Most High"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01956352-9ead-41c1-bf22-1fafc8ba571b",
                                                "sense_id": "e399de0d-ad16-38ee-9250-bd9d39f1d030",
                                                "text": "To celebrate the centenary next month of the opening of the first section (Forest Gate to Tilbury) of the former London, Tilbury & Southend Railway, the Stephenson Locomotive Society is organising a special rail tour over that route and other lesser-known L.T.S.R. lines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4afb20e6-1b19-4f7d-8dfe-02e9336abc01",
                                                "sense_id": "e399de0d-ad16-38ee-9250-bd9d39f1d030",
                                                "text": "Okay, that is simply not true. If that were the case, you wouldn’t need to have an Olympics. The whole reason we do this is to find out who is better than everyone else, so that we can make them stand higher than the other people who are not as good as them, because the point of the games is not to celebrate equality. It is to celebrate individuals’ excellence. So let us all settle in for two incredible weeks of celebrating the fittest, the bravest, the most beautiful and of course, the drunkest of us all. “Did somebody say ‘party’?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98a3b961-0a23-3d40-a203-0129c1571206",
                                        "entry_id": "6cbd5a5a-aa79-3287-92cb-ed2efb6a2c43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To honour by rites, by ceremonies of joy and respect, or by refraining from ordinary business; to observe duly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa3d7b5f-4405-4534-80ea-75d8159cc882",
                                                "sense_id": "98a3b961-0a23-3d40-a203-0129c1571206",
                                                "text": "to celebrate a birthday"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b15c6ad7-3367-4018-a470-b7248498e24b",
                                                "sense_id": "98a3b961-0a23-3d40-a203-0129c1571206",
                                                "text": "Hester Earle and Violet Wayne were moving about the aisle with bundles of wheat-ears and streamers of ivy, for the harvest thanksgiving was shortly to be celebrated, while the vicar stood waiting for their directions on the chancel steps with a great handful of crimson gladioli."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34675088-3107-3b11-b0ac-fb09d088ef3d",
                                        "entry_id": "6cbd5a5a-aa79-3287-92cb-ed2efb6a2c43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in joyful activity in appreciation of an event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82f475b1-8c77-43c0-9cfe-0b76e3980936",
                                                "sense_id": "34675088-3107-3b11-b0ac-fb09d088ef3d",
                                                "text": "I was promoted today at work—let’s celebrate!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de12af32-48d5-44c0-a5e8-198b15729f14",
                                                "sense_id": "34675088-3107-3b11-b0ac-fb09d088ef3d",
                                                "text": "As Di Matteo celebrated and captain John Terry raised the trophy for the fourth time, the Italian increased his claims to become the permanent successor to Andre Villas-Boas by landing a trophy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a83707d0-5059-37c3-aaf4-0686c291b3ca",
                                        "entry_id": "6cbd5a5a-aa79-3287-92cb-ed2efb6a2c43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform or participate in, as a sacrament or solemn rite; to perform with appropriate rites."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "202e0e0f-4454-4be0-9d90-9d032d65cb53",
                                                "sense_id": "a83707d0-5059-37c3-aaf4-0686c291b3ca",
                                                "text": "to celebrate a marriage"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
